msgstr "Prebrzo šaljete poruke. Sačekajte trenutak."

#: src/components/message/InviteLink.tsx:60
#: src/components/message/InviteLink.tsx:82
msgid "You've been invited to join a Space"
msgstr "Pozvani ste da se pridružite Prostoru"

#: src/components/onboarding/steps/DisplayNameStep.tsx:60
msgid "Your account address is a unique public identifier derived from your account key. Others can use it to find and message you. Think of it like a username that can never change."
msgstr "Adresa vašeg naloga je jedinstveni javni identifikator izveden iz ključa vašeg naloga. Drugi ga mogu koristiti da vas pronađu i pošalju vam poruku. Zamislite to kao korisničko ime koje se nikada ne može promeniti."

#: src/components/onboarding/steps/ImportKeyStep.tsx:179
msgid "Your account key is a private key that proves ownership of your account. You can download it as a file (.key) or copy it from your account settings. Keep it safe — whoever has it can access your account."
msgstr "Ključ vašeg naloga je privatni ključ koji dokazuje vlasništvo nad vašim nalogom. Možete ga preuzeti kao datoteku (.key) ili ga kopirati iz podešavanja vašeg naloga. Čuvajte ga bezbedno — ko god ga ima, može pristupiti vašem nalogu."

#: src/components/onboarding/steps/SaveKeyToPasskeyStep.tsx:36
msgid "Your account key is your unique identity in Quorum. It's like a master password that proves you are you - but it's generated automatically and stored securely in your passkey."
msgstr "Ključ vašeg naloga je vaš jedinstveni identitet u Quorumu. To je kao glavna lozinka koja dokazuje da ste to vi – ali se automatski generiše i sigurno čuva u vašem passkey-u."

#: src/components/onboarding/steps/WelcomeStep.tsx:18
msgid "Your communities, your rules - no platform can ban you."
msgstr "Vaše zajednice, vaša pravila – nijedna platforma vas ne može zabraniti."

#: src/components/modals/SpaceSettingsModal/Account.tsx:182
msgid "Your Details"
msgstr "Vaši detalji"

#: src/components/modals/UserSettingsModal/Privacy.tsx:292
msgid "Your display name, profile picture, and bio will be readable by anyone with your Quorum address, including people outside the Spaces you share with them. Existing Space members will see your latest profile even if they joined before you set it. You can turn this off at any time."
msgstr "Vaše ime za prikaz, profilna slika i biografija biće čitljivi svima koji imaju vašu Quorum adresu, uključujući ljude izvan Prostora koje delite sa njima. Postojeći članovi Prostora će videti vaš najnoviji profil čak i ako su se pridružili pre nego što ste ga postavili. Ovo možete isključiti u bilo kom trenutku."

