#: src/components/modals/UserSettingsModal/Security.tsx:713
msgid "Your private key"
msgstr "Vaš privatni ključ"

#: src/components/modals/UserSettingsModal/Security.tsx:545
msgid "Your private key is the only proof of ownership of your account. Anyone who has it can impersonate you and steal your Space's Apex earnings. Never share it."
msgstr "Vaš privatni ključ je jedini dokaz vlasništva nad vašim nalogom. Svako ko ga ima može vas lažno predstavljati i ukrasti Apex zaradu vašeg Prostora. Nikada ga ne delite."

